    "detailed_description": "Angkor: Celebrations is a family friendly Match-3 with engaging gameplay. The game also includes (skippable) minigames.<br><br>Every hundred years, the magicians and sages of Angkor celebrate the humble beginnings of the secret mage town.<br><br>A disciple with great potential is chosen and assigned a very important task: to locate the pieces and assemble the ceremonial k\u012bla. Without the fully assembled k\u012bla, the doors to the temple will not open and the celebrations cannot begin.<br><br><i>This year, the great honour of assembling the ceremonial k\u012bla was bestowed upon you\u2026</i><br><br>Enjoy the game the way you want: Play timed, move limited, or endless. Choose difficulty and graphics quality. Play the minigames, or skip them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>\u272a Pick up and play<br><br>\u272a 101 levels of fun match making<br>\u272a Fun mini games included<br>\u272a Gameplay options can be changed anytime<br>\u272a New types of runes and tiles",
